      en: ["The highest point in the Visayas region at 2,465 meters.", "One of the most active volcanoes in the Philippines.", "Has erupted more than 30 times since 1819.", "A spiritual place in local folklore and for rituals.", "Habitat for the endangered Visayan Warty Pig.", "The summit features multiple craters and a caldera.", "The surrounding area was declared a national park in 1934."],
